// Title: Add DisallowRun Execution to Registry
// Rule ID: 275641a5-a492-45e2-a817-7c81e9d9d3e9
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1112
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_disallowrun_execution.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
// Sigma rules: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma
